# Bro.exe voice asset manifest.
#
# One entry per line:  kind|dest|url|member
#   kind    = file | tar | tardir
#   dest    = path under the staged voice asset root (e.g. app/src/main/assets/voice)
#   url     = download URL
#   member  = member path inside the archive (tar: one file, tardir: a subtree),
#             empty for file
#
# Hashes/sizes are recorded in scripts/voice_assets.lock (generated on CI, committed).

# --- Local LLM (Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, Q4_K_M, Apache-2.0) --------------------
# Shipped IN the APK and extracted on first launch; never downloaded on-device.
file|models/qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf|https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-GGUF/resolve/main/qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct-q4_k_m.gguf|
file|licenses/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-Apache-2.0.txt|https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct-GGUF/resolve/main/LICENSE|

